<title>BANGLADESH: United Insurance Company '96 profit up 1.97 pct.</title>
<headline>United Insurance Company '96 profit up 1.97 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>	 (million taka unless stated)</p>
<p>				1996		     1995</p>
<p>   Gross Premium income 139	 vs	   136</p>
<p>   Premium deposit	 60	 vs	    53</p>
<p>   Net profit		15.5     vs	    15.2</p>
<p>   Gross profit	    22	 vs	    23</p>
<p>   Dividend	    20  taka on 100-taka share vs 17 percent</p>
<p>(Note: United Insurance Company Limited held its general meeting on Tuesday. It said the company's performance was not satisfactory due to the high incidence of claims arising out of riot and arson during the political unrest in the year.)</p>
</text>
